-2ed-kiasyd-bloodline?p=798221#post798221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Watching this for updates.<br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> BTW, there's a small typo wherein you wrote Khaibit instead of Kiasyd.</div> </div> </div> </div> Let's pretend that it didn't happen. lol\u200b<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T07:55:22-08:00","id":798253,"title":"","content":"Noted <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> So, am I going to assume the rituals you'll be creating for Mytherceria will be more or less translations from the OWoD Discipline? Or perhaps you're going to be looking to some Changeling Contracts (most likely the Universal and Goblin ones) for additional inspiration?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T09:34:00-08:00","id":798294,"title":"","content":"I already have a bunch of rituals from lvl 1 to 3, but they are all in portuguese. I'm going to eat something and them I'll translate them. I used the 3 different Mytherceria Disciplines from OWoD and I picked some fairy tales concepts too, like Pan's Labyrinth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-03T02:55:08-08:00","id":799251,"title":"","content":"These look good, so far, barring a few tidbits that need clarifying or revising. The ones I can point out, at the moment are these...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b><u>Open the Gate</u></b><br /> <b>Target Number of Successes</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\">: 5</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\">The Kiasyd opens an artificial portal for the Frontier. The portal last for a full scene and can allow for (Potency) people to enter. This ritual doesn't cost Vitae inside the Frontier.<br /> </span></span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\"><br /> <br /> Perhaps you can rewrite this instead to have the portal lasting for a number of turns equal to Potency? 1E Changeling states that a Hedge Gate opens for a number of turns equal to the activating Changeling's Wyrd after it is no longer being used.</span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b><u>Folderol Fragrance</u></b><br /> <b>Target Number of Successes</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\">: 6</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\">The Kiasyd creates a perfume that can pierce through lies. The next (Potency) lies told to the Kiasyd that night will make the liar bite his tongue, this causes a single point of bashing damage. Supernatural tentatives of lying are subject to a Clash of Wills.<br /> </span></span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\"><br /> <br /> In the last sentence, were you meaning to say &quot;supernatural forms of lying are subject to a Clash of Wills&quot;?</span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-03T10:27:37-08:00","id":799693,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the feedback, I made some alterations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-18T15:43:32-08:00","id":811353,"title":"","content":"I really like this. Could use a bit more detail overall, but definitely like the idea of updating them to CofD. A couple of suggestions for Mythercaria:<br /> *Some of your rituals don't list their range, which Cruac tends to make clear in the ritual description. Usually it's either they need to be in your presence or within a mile, depending. I tend to suggest the latter for anything 'hostile' since you rarely have someone around long enough to cast a ritual if you want to cause problems for them.<br /> *Open the gate should probably be higher than level 1 if it actualyl creates a new portal. At level 1, even for Mytherceria, I'd suggest it need to be used to open an existing gateway.<br /> *Gnomes of stone should perhaps say they can be seen only by those that can see past the Mask normally (so both Ensorcelled mortals and those with mask-piercing powers can potentially see them).<br /> *The harvest doesn't say if the target loses health/vitae like with normal feeding. If they do, it should probably be higher level, IMO.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-18T18:18:13-08:00","id":811431,"title":"","content":"I have updated some of the rituals, and I'm planning on posting some things for the more powerful levels.<br /> I appreciate the feedback so far.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>falco1029</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/797915-2ed-kiasyd-bloodline?p=811353#post811353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*Open the gate should probably be higher than level 1 if it actualyl creates a new portal. At level 1, even for Mytherceria, I'd suggest it need to be used to open an existing gateway.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm waiting for Changeling 2ed to have a better understanding of how rare the gateways will be, but the original idea is to give a the Kiasyd a way to interact with the Frontier from home, I made some changes to the ritual, but you're probably right, maybe a level 2 ritual?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-18T22:27:29-08:00","id":811558,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Horodrigo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/797915-2ed-kiasyd-bloodline?p=811431#post811431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have updated some of the rituals, and I'm planning on posting some things for the more powerful levels.<br /> I appreciate the feedback so far.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm waiting for Changeling 2ed to have a better understanding of how rare the gateways will be, but the original idea is to give a the Kiasyd a way to interact with the Frontier from home, I made some changes to the ritual, but you're probably right, maybe a level 2 ritual?</div> </div> </div> </div>I can see wanting to wait until Changeling 2e to get a better idea. In the meantime, I'd split it into two rituals; a level one ritual that can open existing gateways, and a level 3 ritual for creating a new one. But that's just my view of it. Still, 3rd level is when most powers start crossing into other realms so fully.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-19T05:38:52-08:00","id":811714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>falco1029</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/797915-2ed-kiasyd-bloodline?p=811558#post811558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I can see wanting to wait until Changeling 2e to get a better idea. In the meantime, I'd split it into two rituals; a level one ritual that can open existing gateways, and a level 3 ritual for creating a new one. But that's just my view of it. Still, 3rd level is when most powers start crossing into other realms so fully.</div> </div> </div> </div> \u200bThat's a great idea. I'll add some level 3 rituals today.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}